"looking for ways to improve the site. So, if you've got any great ideas, "
"then please let us know about them. Or, if you know of some important "
"information that isn't listed here, email the author and tell them you want "
"it listed on this site! It'll help make this server a better site for the "
"whole community - and that's who we're here to serve."
